{"text": "\u2018Arasuirma Makalesi/ Research Article dur Uni Fen BilimleriEnst Det. / lr Uni. J Inst Sct. & Tech, 6(3) 69-75, 2016\n\nCapacitance Voltage Characterization of Bifacial Silicon Solar Cell\nUnder Polychromatic Modulated Illumination\n\nGokhan SAHIN!\n\nABSTRACT: The aim of this work isto presenta theorical study of a capacitance voltage characterization\nof a bifacial silicon solar cell under polychromatic modulated illumination. From the excess minority\ncarrier's density inthe solar cell, the photocurrent density and the photovoltage are derived. The diffusion\ncapacitance was measured with both as a function of voltage and the junction surface recombination\nvelocity. Electric polarization effectsare shown through different C-V plots. Forall the studied parameters,\nwe exhibited the effect of electric field parameters on the capacitance voltage characterization and the\n\u2018operating point ofthe cell through the junction recombination velocity.\n\nKeywords: Capacitance, electric field, silicon solar cell\n\ndir Cniversitesi Fen Bilimleri Enstitiisti Dergisi\n\u2018Igdir University Journal of the Institute of Science and Technology\n\nGenis Sekturumlu Aydinlatma altinda iki Yiizeyli Silikon Giines\nPilinin Difiizyon Kapasitansi ve Asiri Azmhk Tasiyici Yogunlugu\n\nw\na\na\n=)\ntz\n\nOZET: Bu calismanin amact, genis spektrumlu aydinlatma altinda iki yiizeyli silikon_giines pilinin\n4ifiizyon kapasitansi ve asin azinlk tastyici yogunlugu teorik galismasinin sunulmasidir. Gines pili asin\nazinlik tastyteisindan fotoakim ve fotogerlim yogunlugu tretilmistir, Difizyon kapasitanst hem voltajin\nfonksiyonu ile hem de baglant yiizeyi rekombinasyon biz ile \u00e9lgilmiistir. Elektrik polarizasyon etkileri\nfarkh C-V (Difizyon kapasitansi- Gerilim) grafikleri ile g\u00e9sterilmistir. Tim calisilan parametreler\niin, karakterizasyon volta} kapasitansinmn elektrik alan parametreleri tizerindeki etkisi ve kavsak\nrekombinasyon hiza boyunca hiicrenin operasyon noktasinin etki g8sterilmistr.\n\nAnahtar Kelimeler: Elektrik alan, kapasitans, silikon giines hiieresi\n\nBr Oniverstes, MitendisikFakites, Este Electrons Enginesrng I, Turkiye\nSirumbs yusaConespoing Auber: Gikban \u00a7AHIN, onyakayscrgikunacom\n\nISSN: 2146-0574, DOI: 10.21597/is.2016321841\n\nCab Volume: 6, Sayissue: 3, Sayfalpp: 69-78, 2016\n\nGel arb Received 18082016\nKabul ari Accepted: 29.042016",
